(7571539, 1215615, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting find and capture.</td>', 'interesting find and capture.', '2018-06-13 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7571540, 1215403, 806, '<td valign="top">a little dark but interesting clouds. i think cropping off the top 1/5 of the image helps to bring the viewer into the image more.</td>', 'a little dark but interesting clouds. i think cropping off the top 1/5 of the image helps to bring the viewer into the image more.', '2018-06-13 13:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7571541, 1215653, 806, '<td valign="top">the distant tree on the left is cool, but I don''t see it at first. cool silhouette of the heron, and I like the stopped water rather than the flowing water done with a slower shutter speed. I like the tension it causes as you expect tranquility here but it makes me hear the water splattering disrupting the scene.</td>', 'the distant tree on the left is cool, but I don''t see it at first. cool silhouette of the heron, and I like the stopped water rather than the flowing water done with a slower shutter speed. I like the tension it causes as you expect tranquility here but it makes me hear the water splattering disrupting the scene.', '2018-06-13 13:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7571542, 1215647, 806, '<td valign="top">hazy day. life goes on in the valley but the stone structure persists overlooking the scene.repeating shapes in the hills and the lone taller tree on the shore mimicking the stone tower helps to move your eye around the image. I can''t decide if I''d like more contrast...................</td>', 'hazy day. life goes on in the valley but the stone structure persists overlooking the scene.repeating shapes in the hills and the lone taller tree on the shore mimicking the stone tower helps to move your eye around the image. I can''t decide if I''d like more contrast...................', '2018-06-13 13:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7571543, 1215432, 806, '<td valign="top">boats lead your eye to lady liberty. beautiful rays. the clouds have a lot of noise in them.</td>', 'boats lead your eye to lady liberty. beautiful rays. the clouds have a lot of noise in them.', '2018-06-13 13:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7571655, 1215633, 159132, '<td valign="top">I am not crazy about the foreground in this pic or I would have gone higher</td>', 'I am not crazy about the foreground in this pic or I would have gone higher', '2018-06-13 20:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7571695, 1215504, 114285, '<td valign="top">What a seriously beautiful night that wouldve been. I already commented previously on another photo that it was the winner but I might be wrong, this could be it!!</td>', 'What a seriously beautiful night that wouldve been. I already commented previously on another photo that it was the winner but I might be wrong, this could be it!!', '2018-06-14 09:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
