(7571770, 1215645, 806, '<td valign="top">excellent. leading lines, mist partially obscuring the distance. beautiful reflections. the "magic 3" people walking in a triangle shape. nice clear detail. tranquil scene. well done!</td>', 'excellent. leading lines, mist partially obscuring the distance. beautiful reflections. the "magic 3" people walking in a triangle shape. nice clear detail. tranquil scene. well done!', '2018-06-14 16:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
